{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010_03_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:27d6fd712d6da0a21ebc85c7da7cbfc60c70dcc860e81c985e52506717999639",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3150c012b6e0d7b8aa37de934c00f0e69549b45079e77cee0dd473a35b1b5ca3",
      "text": "那时的我毫无人生目标，只是在盲目地旅行。\n……但是，那次相遇让我拥有了梦想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dc159c1a0e372eaa98551041299e516f3fd575fba9eeff8e57d39701b3a4e2e",
      "text": "我也想开一家像他那样，能成为某个人的归宿，\n让任何人都能获得幸福的店。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa567e57472f08af103c40cfabaaede6047c9aacf71a98e91caa923d304db6c3",
      "text": "之后为了开店，我前往英国\n开始了红茶的修行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb9167c5f2b196299b356fd0208be122b0c8b5fc6bcef253944c90b92dabbbe8",
      "text": "对当时那家小餐馆的男性和那一杯红茶，\n我怎么感谢都不为过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a6990290370807dcc898b358f10bb7226762834b3f74fade286ea9e2d46b998",
      "text": "我究竟得到了多么大的拯救与幸福啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbcd96f3e302c598b128a535e9c8a12a46468fcf47521e7229f9926467b6b663",
      "text": "呵呵！行动力真强。\n……不过神谷先生的心情，我也能明白。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55b1e198f5a65f1ac9e293f3895657765ba6a6cc7210d5da147c7ff524b7bd2a",
      "text": "因为神谷先生的红茶和店里温暖的氛围，\n也让我感受到了幸福。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56bbd57e0b822e90d56db2317bd37bcbf399333bc46e7dc19c424718d4b7b2c4",
      "text": "（……如果在这里的话，\n“我”也许就能作为“女孩子的我”活下去了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203330604d3a5843cc57a84f27b412460446ef155c36570f5ac8d2d389207221",
      "text": "（卯月君和神谷先生，好像都没注意到\n我是穿着女装的打扮）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8311101354663b1d84f18def50c101bd3242866dc2f6d90533f44624ef32fb89",
      "text": "（……就算被识破了，在这里也许也没关系的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f1f9eb70ea3bb7216bc559286bf1bf8a0e63551e44d1437fdc2c15ebdd79493",
      "text": "那个！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
